{"id":"conv_03486","context":"A new HR memo on the salary system; manager and assistant discuss","ambient":"office_quiet_low","cast":["kenji_office","yuki_office"],"tier":3,"lines":[{"speaker":"kenji_office","mood":null,"en":"Yuki, that new memo on the salary system from Suzuki in HR was distributed, right?","jp":"ゆきさん、人事の鈴木さんから新しい給与制度のメモが配布されましたね。","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[1,6,8,14,19,20,28,50,51,58,326,339,2381,2499,2861,3198,3345,3348,4579,4781,17752],"jpTokens":[{"s":"ゆき","w":4579},{"s":"さん","w":50},{"s":"、"},{"s":"人事","r":"じんじ","w":3198},{"s":"の","w":1},{"s":"鈴木","r":"すずき","w":2499},{"s":"さん","w":50},{"s":"から","w":20},{"s":"新しい","r":"あたらしい","w":339},{"s":"給与","r":"きゅうよ","w":3345},{"s":"制度","r":"せいど","w":326},{"s":"の","w":1},{"s":"メモ","w":2381},{"s":"が","w":6},{"s":"配布","r":"はいふ","w":3348},{"s":"さ","w":19},{"s":"れ","w":58},{"s":"まし","w":14},{"s":"た","w":8},{"s":"ね","w":51},{"s":"。"}]},{"speaker":"yuki_office","mood":null,"en":"Yes, I received it earlier. Apparently we also need to update our salary deposit bank accounts starting next month.","jp":"はい、先ほど受け取りました。来月から給与の振込先口座の変更手続きも必要だそうですよ。","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[1,8,11,14,17,20,21,28,61,68,116,187,271,295,807,878,2100,2701,3345,3370,4781,5763,6312,6974,10326],"jpTokens":[{"s":"はい","w":2100},{"s":"、"},{"s":"先","r":"さき","w":295},{"s":"ほど","w":187},{"s":"受け取り","r":"うけとり","w":5763},{"s":"まし","w":14},{"s":"た","w":8},{"s":"。"},{"s":"来月","r":"らいげつ","w":6312},{"s":"から","w":20},{"s":"給与","r":"きゅうよ","w":3345},{"s":"の","w":1},{"s":"振込","r":"ふりこみ","w":10326},{"s":"先","r":"さき","w":295},{"s":"口座","r":"こうざ","w":3370},{"s":"の","w":1},{"s":"変更","r":"へんこう","w":807},{"s":"手続き","r":"てつづき","w":2701},{"s":"も","w":11},{"s":"必要","r":"ひつよう","w":116},{"s":"だ","w":21},{"s":"そう","w":61},{"s":"です","w":17},{"s":"よ","w":68},{"s":"。"}]},{"speaker":"kenji_office","mood":null,"en":"What, changing accounts? That's a hassle… will official paperwork be issued for it?","jp":"ええっ、口座の変更ですか。それは面倒ですね…正式な書類は交付され